@baseUrl = https://localhost:5003
@token = {{your-jwt-token}}

### Create Culture Object
POST {{baseUrl}}/culture-objects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Moderna galerija Zagreb",
  "contactEmail": "info@moderna.hr",
  "address": "Andrije Hebranga 1",
  "zipCode": 10000,
  "city": "Zagreb",
  "adminUserId": 1
}

### Get All Culture Objects
GET {{baseUrl}}/culture-objects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Culture Object by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/culture-objects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
